WEBVTT

00:02:29.836 --> 00:02:33.636
Monica Araya: A big detox
of transportation is possible.

00:02:33.676 --> 00:02:36.276
Cory Combs: Electrification
will permeate everything.

00:02:36.316 --> 00:02:38.796
Al Gore: A phase-out
of internal combustion engines.

00:02:38.836 --> 00:02:41.716
Rumaitha Al Busaidi: Educating
and empowering women and girls

00:02:41.796 --> 00:02:43.836
is one of the single most important things

00:02:43.876 --> 00:02:46.396
that we can do
to confront carbon pollution.

00:02:46.396 --> 00:02:49.116
Rose M. Mutiso: Everyone must get
to a zero carbon future.

00:02:49.156 --> 00:02:52.156
DC: When we connect our stories
and play an active part,

00:02:52.276 --> 00:02:54.236
our imaginations are the only limit.

00:02:54.236 --> 00:02:57.156
Christiana Figueres: In radical
collaboration with each other,

00:02:57.276 --> 00:02:58.396
we can do this.

00:02:58.396 --> 00:03:00.516
Colette Pichon Battle:
And while we're at it,